d></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Patients aged &#x0003c;60 years</td><td align="left">25 (1.2)</td><td align="left">-</td><td align="left">25 (1.2)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Patients aged 60 to 64 years</td><td align="left">7 (1.7)</td><td align="left">-</td><td align="left">7 (1.7)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Patients aged &#x0003e;64 years</td><td align="left">4 (1.5)</td><td align="left">-</td><td align="left">4 (1.5)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;<italic>P </italic>value</td><td align="left">0.615</td><td align="left">-</td><td align="left">0.615</td></tr><tr><td align="left" colspan="4">Nail changes grade 1 to grade 3</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Patients aged &#x0003c;60 years</td><td align="left">849 (39.1)</td><td align="left">-</td><td align="left">849 (39.1)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Patients aged 60 to 64 years</td><td align="left">171 (41.3)</td><td align="left">-</td><td align="left">171 (41.3)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Patients aged &#x0003e;64 years</td><td align="left">100 (38.8)</td><td align="left">-</td><td align="left">100 (38.8)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;<italic>P </italic>value</td><td align="left">0.680</td><td align="left">-</td><td align="left">0.680</td></tr><tr><td align="left" colspan="4">Nail changes grade 3</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Patients aged &#x0003c;60 years</td><td align="left">22 (1.0)</td><td align="left">-</td><td align="left">22 (1.0)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Patients aged 60 to 64 years</td><td align="left">6 (1.4)</td><td align="left">-</td><td align="left">6 (1.4)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Patients aged &#x0003e;64 years</td><td align="left">1 (0.4)</td><td align="left">-</td><td align="left">1 (0.4)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;<italic>P </italic>value</td><td align="left">0.411</td><td align="left">-</td><td align="left">0.411</td></tr><tr><td align="left" colspan="4">Skin changes grade 